# A9: LMC v0 — liver-referenced multi-scale contrast skip gate (docs/方法重设计_可检出性计划.md §2.2, simplified in §11)
# Same gate form as A1; the gate signal is the contrast of the input CT relative to a predicted liver mask.
PHASER_LMC=1
PHASER_LMC_LIVER_WEIGHT=0.1
# Shared V2 settings (every group). Seed is set by queue.sh (PHASER_SEED).
PHASER_NUM_EPOCHS=200
PHASER_FT_WEIGHT=0.0
PHASER_PC_SCALES=3
PHASER_PC_MAX_VOXELS=1048576
PHASER_AUX_WARMUP=5
PHASER_FUSION=none
